        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/ff46373cf3567a23d13a644d340aacb3f188dcf4"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree ff46373cf3567a23d13a644d340aacb3f188dcf4\nparent 56db08d5291a533f75df89ba88f8b06deac0eebd\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1784922309 -0700\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1787245823 -0700\n\ntest: avoid undersized Boost.Test signal stacks\n\nBoost.Test registers a `SIGSTKSZ` alternate signal stack as each test binary starts, before any tests run.\nOn musl, this can be smaller than Linux's hardware-dependent minimum, causing `sigaltstack()` to fail with `ENOMEM` during setup.\n\nDisable Boost.Test's alternate stack in both test entry points.\nSignal handlers continue to use the regular process stack. Boost.Test can no longer report stack overflows.\n\nFixes #36026\n\nCo-authored-by: MarcoFalke <*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz>\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQQiU97U54YbP0PlTVgnCd/LLYEwhwUCaoc0/xsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQJwnfyy2BMIfcbwEA223/FcMTyVdsIKrbFi+4\nObGYPlBrPeRe6AbA9CCPJE8A/jAr10GrQ+J5Y+r00+TYggS0AEyy2v0uiEJ9AOAe\n9lkD\n=k7zF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
      },
      "parents": [
        {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/56db08d5291a533f75df89ba88f8b06deac0eebd",
          "sha": "56db08d5291a533f75df89ba88f8b06deac0eebd",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/56db08d5291a533f75df89ba88f8b06deac0eebd"
        }
      ],
      "message": "test: avoid undersized Boost.Test signal stacks\n\nBoost.Test registers a `SIGSTKSZ` alternate signal stack as each test binary starts, before any tests run.\nOn musl, this can be smaller than Linux's hardware-dependent minimum, causing `sigaltstack()` to fail with `ENOMEM` during setup.\n\nDisable Boost.Test's alternate stack in both test entry points.\nSignal handlers continue to use the regular process stack. Boost.Test can no longer report stack overflows.\n\nFixes #36026\n\nCo-authored-by: MarcoFalke <*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz>",
